%N A399454 Total number of maximal matchings in all labeled trees on n vertices.
%H A399454 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A399454/b399454.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..300</a>
%H A399454 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/MaximalIndependentEdgeSet.html">Maximal Independent Edge Set</a>.
%o A399454 (PARI) seq(n)={my(u=v=O(x)); while(serprec(u,x)<=n, my(t=x*exp(v)); v=x^2*exp(u+v)^2; u=t); Vec(serlaplace(intformal(O(x^n) + (u + v)/x)))}
